{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@'s recognized proxy settings were prepared temporarily and will be restored after it quits. A fresh instance was opened with Rockxy's scoped environment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已临时准备 %@ 的已识别代理设置，并将在该应用退出后恢复。已使用 Rockxy 的作用域环境打开新实例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was opened with temporary proxy settings. Keep Rockxy open until the application quits so those settings can be restored safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已使用临时代理设置打开 %@。请保持 Rockxy 运行，直到该应用退出，以便安全恢复这些设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was opened with an explicit scoped proxy and Rockxy's environment. These launch settings remain active until the application quits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已使用显式作用域代理和 Rockxy 环境打开 %@。这些启动设置会持续生效，直到该应用退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ was opened with Rockxy's scoped environment. If it overrides macOS or environment proxy settings, configure that app-level proxy separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已使用 Rockxy 的作用域环境打开 %@。如果它会覆盖 macOS 或环境代理设置，请单独配置该应用级代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose & Open Developer App…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择并打开开发者应用…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a developer application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择开发者应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a fully quit developer application to open with Rockxy's scoped proxy and certificate environment. Rockxy also prepares recognized app-level proxy settings to follow the active macOS System Proxy at %@. Containers, emulators, devices, and already-running processes remain separate capture boundaries.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择一个已完全退出的开发者应用，使用 Rockxy 的作用域代理和证书环境打开。Rockxy 还会准备已识别的应用级代理设置，使其使用当前的 macOS 系统代理 %@。容器、模拟器、设备和已运行的进程仍是独立的捕获边界。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a valid macOS application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择有效的 macOS 应用程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开发者应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable macOS System Proxy in Rockxy before opening %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在 Rockxy 中启用 macOS 系统代理，再打开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open with Rockxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Rockxy 打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a fresh app instance with scoped proxy and certificate settings; recognized app-level proxy settings are prepared safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用作用域代理和证书设置打开新的应用实例；已识别的应用级代理设置会被安全准备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit %@ completely, then try again so its proxy state and launch environment cannot be stale.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请完全退出 %@ 后重试，避免使用过期的代理状态和启动环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the Rockxy proxy before opening a developer application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先启动 Rockxy 代理，再打开开发者应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The application's HTTP Proxy settings file is malformed. Rockxy left it unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该应用的 HTTP 代理设置文件格式错误。Rockxy 未对其进行更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The application rewrote its temporary proxy settings into an unreadable form. Rockxy restored the original settings and preserved the unreadable copy at %@. Review it, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用将临时代理设置改写成了无法读取的格式。Rockxy 已恢复原始设置，并将无法读取的副本保存在 %@。请检查该副本后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected application's proxy metadata could not be read safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法安全读取所选应用的代理元数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected application reported an unsafe settings location. Rockxy left it unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选应用报告了不安全的设置位置。Rockxy 未对其进行更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "open the developer application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开开发者应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more clients rejected the Rockxy certificate for multiple HTTPS hosts. The macOS Root CA is trusted, so the affected client may use a separate trust store or certificate pinning. Restart or configure that client before retrying interception.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个或多个客户端在多个 HTTPS 主机上拒绝了 Rockxy 证书。macOS Root CA 已受信任，因此受影响的客户端可能使用独立的信任存储或证书固定。请重新启动或配置该客户端后再重试解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more clients rejected the Rockxy certificate for multiple HTTPS hosts. Check the Rockxy Root CA in Keychain Access and any client-specific trust store, then restart the affected client.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个或多个客户端在多个 HTTPS 主机上拒绝了 Rockxy 证书。请检查“钥匙串访问”中的 Rockxy Root CA 以及客户端专用信任存储，然后重新启动受影响的客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added host Decrypt rules for domains observed from %@. These rules apply to every application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已为从 %@ 观察到的域名添加主机解密规则。这些规则适用于所有应用程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Configured %lld of %lld observed hosts. Review Tunnel or bypass rules for the remaining hosts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已配置 %lld 个观察主机（共 %lld 个）。请检查其余主机的隧道或绕过规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creates host rules that apply to these domains in every application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "创建适用于每个应用程序中这些域名的主机规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypt This Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密此主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review Rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set domains observed from %@ to Tunnel. These host rules apply to every application.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将从 %@ 观察到的域名设为隧道传输。这些主机规则适用于所有应用程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host is unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host is in Full Proxy Bypass. Remove that bypass entry before decrypting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机位于完整代理绕过列表中。请先移除该绕过条目，再进行解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This host is in the HTTPS TLS Bypass list. Remove that bypass pattern before decrypting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机位于 HTTPS TLS 绕过列表中。请先移除该绕过模式，再进行解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel rule %@ takes priority. Review that broader rule before decrypting this host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道规则 %@ 优先。解密此主机前，请检查该范围更广的规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel This Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道传输此主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule with this application and behavior already exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已存在具有此应用和行为的规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an application, host pattern, or observed hosts to decrypt HTTPS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加应用、主机模式或已观察主机以解密 HTTPS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Application…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加应用…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Observed Hosts…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加已观察主机…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies to new connections after the app reconnects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用重新连接后，此规则将应用于新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Capture new traffic from a local app, then return here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从本地应用捕获新流量，然后返回此处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an application, host pattern, or observed hosts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择应用、主机模式或已观察主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an observed local app. The rule follows its stable identity across every HTTPS host it uses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择已观察到的本地应用。该规则使用稳定身份，适用于其访问的所有 HTTPS 主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Behavior": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择行为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Decrypt or Tunnel behavior for new application connections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为应用的新连接选择解密或隧道传输行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose how Rockxy handles HTTPS from this application on new connections": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 Rockxy 如何处理此应用的新 HTTPS 连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypt All HTTPS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密所有 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypt All HTTPS from This Application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密此应用的所有 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypt Observed Hosts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密已观察主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypt Only This Host": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅解密此主机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decrypting an entire app can expose sensitive traffic and use more CPU and memory. Add Tunnel rules for exceptions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密整个应用可能暴露敏感流量并使用更多 CPU 和内存。可添加隧道规则作为例外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "decrypt": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Application Rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑应用规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Behavior": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 行为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Local Applications Observed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未观察到本地应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Matching Applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有匹配的应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove Application Rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除应用规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rules decide which apps and hosts Rockxy decrypts. Other connections remain opaque TLS tunnels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则决定 Rockxy 解密哪些应用和主机。其他连接仍为不透明的 TLS 隧道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search applications": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "搜索应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set %@ to decrypt HTTPS. %@ stays tunneled: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Set %1$@ to decrypt HTTPS. %2$@ stays tunneled: %3$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将 %1$@ 设为解密 HTTPS。但 %2$@ 仍以隧道传输：%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set %@ to decrypt HTTPS. Matching tunneled connections reset automatically — if one stays tunneled, reconnect the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Set %1$@ to decrypt HTTPS. Matching tunneled connections reset automatically — if one stays tunneled, reconnect the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将 %1$@ 设为解密 HTTPS。匹配的实时连接将自动重置——如仍以隧道传输，请重新连接应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel rule %@ takes priority. Change that host behavior before decrypting it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道规则 %@ 优先。请先更改该主机行为，再进行解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set %@ to tunnel HTTPS on new connections. Reconnect the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Set %1$@ to tunnel HTTPS on new connections. Reconnect the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已将 %1$@ 的新 HTTPS 连接设为隧道传输。请重新连接应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This target has both behaviors. Tunnel Without Decryption takes priority.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此目标同时具有两种行为。不解密隧道优先。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The application Tunnel rule takes priority. Change the application behavior first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用隧道规则优先。请先更改应用行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a different app, host, scope, or behavior.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请尝试其他应用、主机、范围或行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a different app, identifier, or host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请尝试其他应用、标识符或主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel All HTTPS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道传输所有 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel All HTTPS from This Application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道传输此应用的所有 HTTPS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道传输应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tunnel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道传输"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "  •  %lld evicted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "  •  已淘汰 %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " // %lld items": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " // %lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " for the host pattern %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " 对应主机模式 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "-%lld": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "—": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "— %@ —": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    ": ": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "\"%@\"": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "\"%@\" could not be read.\n\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "\"%1$@\" could not be read.\n\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取“%1$@”。\n\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has unsaved changes. Save them before switching scripts?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
