            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加规则以修改 HTTP 请求和响应标头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the /api/rockxy-check route handler and start next dev with NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY plus\nHTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY and NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS so server-side fetch trusts the Rockxy CA.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加 /api/rockxy-check 路由处理程序，并使用 NODE_USE_ENV_PROXY 以及\nHTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY 和 NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS 启动 next dev，以便服务器端 fetch 信任 Rockxy CA。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the required authentication credential, then retry the request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加所需的身份验证凭据，然后重试该请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the Rockxy CA to the System keychain": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 Rockxy CA 添加到系统钥匙串"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the route handler and start next dev with NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS + HTTPS_PROXY set.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加路由处理程序，并在设置了 NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS + HTTPS_PROXY 后启动 next dev。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Full Proxy Bypass": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到完全代理绕过"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added %lld iOS requests from %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Added %1$lld iOS requests from %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加来自 %2$@ 的 %1$lld 个 iOS 请求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adding this enabled profile will disable the profile that is currently enabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加这个已启用的配置将停用当前启用的配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds the %lld request(s) hidden by Focus or Noise to this review only. Your Focus and Noise settings will not change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅将被焦点或噪声隐藏的 %lld 个请求添加到本次审查。你的焦点和噪声设置不会更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
