    "After installing the profile, iOS still requires Full Trust under Settings > General > About > Certificate Trust Settings before HTTPS traffic can be decrypted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装描述文件后，iOS 仍需在“设置”>“通用”>“关于本机”>“证书信任设置”中启用完全信任，之后才能解密 HTTPS 流量。"
          }
