            "value": "Apple 终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's headset follows the iOS device path: reach Rockxy across the local network and install the root certificate on the device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 头显沿用 iOS 设备路径：通过本地网络连接 Rockxy，并在设备上安装根证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Application": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Application retry policy is not visible": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用程序重试策略不可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied settings affect new eligible captured connections. Upstream bypass entries are still captured by Rockxy; Rockxy connects to those destinations directly instead of using the upstream proxy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用的设置会影响新的符合条件的已捕获连接。上游绕过条目仍由 Rockxy 捕获；Rockxy 会直接连接这些目标，而不使用上游代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applied to every response from this rule. Valid range: 100–599.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用于此规则的每个响应。有效范围：100–599。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APPLIES IMMEDIATELY": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies throughout the app, including navigation, controls, tables, and inspectors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用于整个应用，包括导航、控件、表格和检查器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Changes & Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用更改并继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply ordered header operations to matching requests and responses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对匹配的请求和响应应用有序的标头操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply templates from the Raw tab in the Breakpoint Queue. A valid request template replaces method, target, headers, and body; a valid response template replaces status, headers, and body.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在断点队列的 Raw 标签页中应用模板。有效的请求模板会替换方法、目标、标头和正文；有效的响应模板会替换状态码、标头和正文。"
          }
        }
