    },
    "For a real Apple TV or Apple Watch, use a reachable LAN address and set the manual HTTP proxy in the device settings where available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对于实体 Apple TV 或 Apple Watch，请使用可访问的局域网地址，并在设备设置中可用的位置设置手动 HTTP 代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For Java, HTTPS interception still needs the Rockxy root CA trusted in the exact JVM or IDE trust store, plus a Decrypt rule for the target application or host under HTTPS Decryption.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对于 Java，HTTPS 拦截仍需要在对应的 JVM 或 IDE 信任库中信任 Rockxy 根 CA，并在 HTTPS 解密中为目标应用或主机添加解密规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example: Checkout API": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如：结账 API"
