      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS content was not inspected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未检查 HTTPS 内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS decryption": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Decryption": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Decryption lets you decrypt traffic from an application or a specific host, or keep it tunneled. Trust Rockxy's root certificate before decrypting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密可让你解密来自某个应用或特定主机的流量，也可以保持隧道传输。解密前请先信任 Rockxy 的根证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS decryption is off. All HTTPS connections are tunneled unread; individual rules keep their state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密已关闭。所有 HTTPS 连接均以隧道方式传输且不被读取；各规则保持其状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS decryption is ready for new connections to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密已就绪，可用于到 %@ 的新连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS decryption is unavailable until the Rockxy root certificate is trusted. HTTPS is tunneled unread for now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在信任 Rockxy 根证书之前，HTTPS 解密不可用。目前 HTTPS 将以隧道方式传输而不被读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Decryption…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS interception is ready for %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已为 %@ 准备好 HTTPS 拦截。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS interception is ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 拦截已就绪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS interception is unavailable because the Rockxy Root CA has not been generated yet. HTTP traffic and logs are still captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未生成 Rockxy 根 CA，因此 HTTPS 拦截不可用。HTTP 流量和日志仍会被捕获。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS interception is unavailable because the Rockxy Root CA is installed but not trusted for SSL. HTTP traffic and logs are still captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rockxy 根 CA 已安装但未被信任用于 SSL，因此 HTTPS 拦截不可用。HTTP 流量和日志仍会被捕获。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS interception is unavailable because the Rockxy Root CA is not installed in the login or System keychain. HTTP traffic and logs are still captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rockxy 根 CA 未安装到登录钥匙串或系统钥匙串，因此 HTTPS 拦截不可用。HTTP 流量和日志仍会被捕获。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Map Local needs SSL Proxying for %@ before this rule can see the request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS Map Local 需要先为 %@ 启用 SSL 代理，此规则才能看到请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS regex or wildcard-host rules require a matching host in HTTPS Decryption. Rockxy cannot safely infer one from this pattern.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 正则表达式或通配符主机规则需要在 HTTPS 解密中有匹配的主机。Rockxy 无法从此模式中安全推断主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS Traffic Interception": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 流量拦截"
          }
        }
      }
    },
