    "I can help with Rockxy's workflows — capture, HTTPS decryption, mapping, breakpoints, rules, and scripting. I couldn't match that to a feature; try naming the workflow or open Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我可以帮助你使用 Rockxy 的各项工作流——捕获、HTTPS 解密、映射、断点、规则和脚本。我无法将其匹配到某项功能；请尝试指明工作流名称，或打开“设置”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
