    },
    "If an app still fails TLS, its network-security-config probably does not trust user CAs; a debug build with a relaxed config is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 App 仍出现 TLS 失败，其 network-security-config 可能不信任用户 CA；需要使用放宽配置的调试构建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Android development mode cannot reach Metro after proxy setup, keep adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081 active. For emulator Wi-Fi proxy settings, bypass localhost; for physical devices, bypass the Mac LAN host used by Metro.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果设置代理后 Android 开发模式无法连接 Metro，请保持 adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081 处于启用状态。对于模拟器 Wi-Fi 代理设置，请绕过 localhost；对于实体设备，请绕过 Metro 使用的 Mac 局域网主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If HTTPS still fails, use Device > Erase All Content and Settings on the simulator and reinstall the certificate before retrying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 HTTPS 仍然失败，请在模拟器中使用 Device > Erase All Content and Settings，并在重试前重新安装证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Rockxy sees nothing, verify the HTTP client you use respects the platform proxy or accepts explicit proxy configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 Rockxy 没有看到任何流量，请验证你使用的 HTTP 客户端是否遵循平台代理或接受显式代理配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app pins certificates, Rockxy cannot decrypt its HTTPS traffic until the debug build relaxes pinning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果应用启用了证书固定，除非调试版本放宽该策略，否则 Rockxy 无法解密其 HTTPS 流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app pins certificates, Rockxy cannot decrypt that HTTPS traffic until the debug build relaxes pinning.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果应用启用了证书固定，则在调试版本放宽该策略之前，Rockxy 无法解密该 HTTPS 流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app pins its own certificates, Rockxy cannot decrypt its traffic until the app is built with pinning relaxed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果应用对自己的证书启用了固定，则在构建应用时放宽该策略之前，Rockxy 无法解密其流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you prefer Terminal, export the public PEM and run xcrun simctl keychain <udid> add-root-cert <path-to-pem> for a prepared simulator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果你更喜欢使用“终端”，请导出公开 PEM，然后为已准备的模拟器运行 xcrun simctl keychain <udid> add-root-cert <path-to-pem>。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you skip client wiring or debug Android trust settings, emulator traffic may bypass Rockxy until a separate automation flow handles routing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果跳过客户端接线或调试 Android 信任设置，模拟器流量可能会绕过 Rockxy，直到单独的自动化流程处理路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
