        }
      }
    },
    "Import the Rockxy root CA into the active JVM's cacerts with keytool, then route traffic\nthrough 127.0.0.1 on Rockxy's port. This flow requires a locally installed JDK.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 keytool 将 Rockxy 根 CA 导入当前 JVM 的 cacerts，然后通过 Rockxy 端口上的 127.0.0.1 路由流量。\n此流程需要本地安装 JDK。"
          }
