    "Load an HTTPS page in Safari or run the target app's login flow once and confirm Rockxy captures the request. A VPN may bypass the Wi-Fi proxy, so disable it while validating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Safari 中加载一个 HTTPS 页面，或运行一次目标应用的登录流程，并确认 Rockxy 捕获到该请求。VPN 可能会绕过 Wi-Fi 代理，因此请在验证时将其停用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load an HTTPS page or run the app's login flow and confirm Rockxy captures the request before you debug deeper.": {
