    "MCP (Model Context Protocol) allows compatible tools to interact with Rockxy. The AI can read captured HTTP traffic, inspect request and response details, export requests as cURL, and view proxy rules and status.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MCP（Model Context Protocol）允许兼容工具与 Rockxy 交互。AI 可以读取捕获的 HTTP 流量、检查请求和响应详细信息、将请求导出为 cURL，以及查看代理规则和状态。"
          }
        }
      }
