    "Run the local probe again and make sure the selected runtime sends it through Rockxy's proxy port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次运行本地探测，并确保所选运行时通过 Rockxy 的代理端口发送该探测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the local validation probe and wait for the first matching capture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行本地验证探测并等待首次匹配的捕获。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the model on this Mac with no API usage fees. Rockxy checks the local runtime before model and traffic actions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上运行模型，无需支付 API 使用费。Rockxy 会在模型和流量操作前检查本地运行时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the React Native fetch probe from the Validate tab and confirm Rockxy captures the target-specific local validation probe before you debug deeper app flows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从“验证”标签页运行 React Native fetch 探测，确认 Rockxy 捕获了目标专用的本地验证探测，然后再调试更深层的应用流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the selected %@ local validation probe and wait for Rockxy to capture GET %@. This confirms the probe reached Rockxy through the proxy, but it does not attribute the request to a specific app, process, device, simulator, emulator, or runtime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Run the selected %1$@ local validation probe and wait for Rockxy to capture GET %2$@. This confirms the probe reached Rockxy through the proxy, but it does not attribute the request to a specific app, process, device, simulator, emulator, or runtime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行所选的 %1$@ 本地验证探针，并等待 Rockxy 捕获 GET %2$@。这确认探针已通过代理到达 Rockxy，但不会将该请求归因于特定的应用、进程、设备、模拟器、仿真器或运行时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the test request again and make sure it points at the Rockxy proxy port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "再次运行测试请求，并确保它指向 Rockxy 代理端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run the Validate tab's generated request from your Flutter client and confirm Rockxy captures it before you debug broader flows. This validates the proxy path, not the exact device, emulator, simulator, or Dart runtime that emitted the request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 Flutter 客户端运行“验证”标签页生成的请求，并在调试更广泛的流程前确认 Rockxy 已捕获该请求。这会验证代理路径，而非发出请求的确切设备、仿真器、模拟器或 Dart 运行时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
